							"content:textarea:13:16": {
								"icon": "align-justify",
								"name": "Paragraph",
								"type": "textarea",
								"html": "<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\tThe Salvation Army Red Shield Youth Center programs are an invaluable resource for children and teenagers, offering a wide range of activities and opportunities for growth and development. These programs are designed to create a safe and supportive environment where young individuals can thrive and reach their full potential. Through a combination of educational, recreational, and character-building activities, The Salvation Army Red Shield Youth Center instills important life skills, fosters academic success, and promotes healthy lifestyles. From mentoring programs and homework assistance to sports, arts, and leadership development initiatives, these programs empower young children to become responsible, confident, and compassionate individuals. By providing a nurturing community and comprehensive programming, The Salvation Army Red Shield Youth Center inspires young minds, promotes positive relationships, and prepares them for a better future.\n</p>",
